{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "id": "e-be-able-to",
  "lexicon": "zkv",
  "number": 35,
  "kind": "phrase",
  "headword": "be able to",
  "star": true,
  "senses": [
    {
      "zh": "能够（有能力）"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "If you save a few coins every day, you’ll "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "be able to"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " buy a mobile in a year."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "如果你每天节省几个硬币，你就可以在一年内购买一部手机。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "be able to 是常考词组，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要掌握以下固定搭配。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "I am not able to do = It is impossible for me to do，在句中可以互换。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如："
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "I am not able to run"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " the 100-metre race within 14 seconds."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "It is impossible for me to run"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " the 100-metre race within 14 seconds."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "我不可能在 14 秒内跑完 100 米比赛。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
